  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Accountant)\n\n### Capium 365: Manage Users\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Thu, 24 Jul, 2025 at  4:53 PM\n\n\t\tClick here to go to the 'Manage' page\n\nWithin the Capium 365 Manage section, the Users area serves as your central hub for efficient user management. This intuitive interface provides all the tools you need to maintain control over your team and their access. Here, you can: \n\nAdd new users to your practice.  \n\nEdit users to pdate user information to keep records accurate and up to date.\n\nAssign users to specific clients to delegate responsibility. \n\nSearch for users by name or status to quickly locate records. \n\nClick here to learn more about how to set user-specific permissions in Capium 365\n\nClick here to learn more about how to manage single user permissions in Capium 365 \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
